---
---
<section class="bg-[#F7F6F4] py-24 px-6" id="register">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <span class="block text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#CC9200] mb-4">What You Will Learn</span>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-black">God's Plan for Their Wallets</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 mt-4 max-w-lg mx-auto">A free webinar for parents and guardians of teens and young adults aged 16–21. Practical, biblical, and built for this generation.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-14">
      {[
        { num: '01', title: 'How to start the money conversation without conflict or shame', desc: 'Most parents avoid this talk because they don\'t know where to begin. We\'ll give you the exact entry point — and what to say first.' },
        { num: '02', title: 'The biblical framework that makes financial wisdom click for young people', desc: 'God\'s word has always had a money blueprint. We\'ll show your teen why it\'s not just spiritual wisdom it\'s the most practical financial advice they\'ll ever receive.' },
        { num: '03', title: 'Why most teens fail financially and the 3 habits that change everything', desc: 'Debt, peer pressure, and impulsive spending don\'t come from bad character. They come from missing foundations. We\'ll show you what to build first.' },
        { num: '04', title: 'How to protect them from the financial traps of their generation', desc: 'Crypto scams, lifestyle inflation, BNPL debt traps, the threats are new but the principles that guard against them are ancient. We\'ll cover both.' },
        { num: '05', title: 'Simple tools to help them start early, stay grounded, and grow wise', desc: 'You\'ll leave with practical, age-appropriate tools you can introduce to your teen immediately, no financial background required.' },
      ].map((card) => (
        <div class="bg-white p-8 border border-gray-200 border-t-4 border-t-[#FFD100]">
          <div class="text-5xl font-bold text-[#FFD100]/25 mb-4" style="font-family:serif">{card.num}</div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-black mb-3 leading-snug">{card.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">{card.desc}</p>
        </div>
      ))}

      <div class="bg-black p-8 border-t-4 border-t-[#FFD100] flex gap-6 items-start md:col-span-3">
        <div class="text-5xl font-bold text-[#FFD100]/20 flex-shrink-0" style="font-family:serif">06</div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-3 leading-snug">How to align their career, calling, and finances before life gets complicated</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-white/45 leading-relaxed">This is the conversation that separates teens who drift from those who launch with direction. We'll show you how to have it at the right time, in the right way.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-lg mx-auto bg-white border border-gray-200 border-t-4 border-t-[#FFD100] p-10">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black mb-2">Save Your Spot - It's Free</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-6">Enter your details below to register for the webinar.</p>
      <div>
        <groovewebinar-registration-widget permalink="AiwKQ1rQsxzSbjmpad2e"></groovewebinar-registration-widget>
        <script src="https://groovewebinar.com/embed/js/app.js"></script>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 text-center mt-4">Limited spots. First come, first blessed. 🙏</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
